      ],
      "messages": {
        "202410000": {
          "id": 202410000,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1003,
          "text": "I was organizing my suitcase and came across a lifetime membership card valid at all hair salons across Planarcadia",
          "next": [
            202410001
          ]
        },
        "202410001": {
          "id": 202410001,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1003,
          "text": "Who should I give it to?",
          "next": [
            202410002,
            202410004,
            202410007
          ]
        },
        "202410002": {
          "id": 202410002,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Me! I'm the only minor on this whole train!",
          "next": [
            202410003
          ]
        },
        "202410003": {
          "id": 202410003,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1003,
          "text": "Knew you'd like it~ There, it's all yours. You could even take everyone out to get their hair done later",
          "next": [
            202410009
          ]
        },
        "202410004": {
          "id": 202410004,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Let me think... March will definitely love it, Dan Heng probably won't refuse, Sunny is pretty clean too, also Mr. Yang has hair...",
          "next": [
            202410005
          ]
        },
        "202410005": {
          "id": 202410005,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "You should just give it to me! I'll take everyone out for a makeover",
          "next": [
            202410006
          ]
        },
        "202410006": {
          "id": 202410006,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1003,
          "text": "Sounds good! I was thinking the same thing~",
          "next": [
            202410009
          ]
        },
        "202410007": {
          "id": 202410007,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "The whole Express family can take turns in the chief stylist's chair. Group makeover!",
          "next": [
            202410008
          ]
        },
        "202410008": {
          "id": 202410008,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1003,
          "text": "I was thinking the same thing~",
          "next": [
            202410009
          ]
        },
        "202410009": {
          "id": 202410009,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1003,
          "text": "Back when I went to school in Planarcadia, I loved experimenting with different hairstyles",
          "next": [
            202410010
          ]
        },
        "202410010": {
          "id": 202410010,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1003,
          "text": "I recall dyeing my hair a color very similar to March's. I even wanted to try a short cut like Dan Heng's, but my stylist fought tooth and nail to stop me",
          "next": [
            202410011
          ]
        },
        "202410011": {
          "id": 202410011,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1003,
          "text": "The final look ended up being more of a mullet, a little like Sunday's",
          "next": [
            202410012
          ]
        },
        "202410012": {
          "id": 202410012,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1003,
          "text": "Come to think of it, they were quite thoughtful to hand in this salon card as their protection money",
          "next": [
            202410013,
            202410019,
            202410024
          ]
        },
        "202410013": {
          "id": 202410013,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "I want to see the full catalog of Himeko hairstyles! Do you have any pictures?",
          "next": [
            202410014
          ]
        },
        "202410014": {
          "id": 202410014,
          "type": "Sticker",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "next": [
            202410015
          ]
        },
        "202410015": {
          "id": 202410015,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Wait, what money???",
          "next": [
            202410016
          ]
        },
        "202410016": {
          "id": 202410016,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1003,
          "text": "Hmm? Oh, just a friendly souvenir I received during my student days",
          "next": [
            202410017
          ]
        },
        "202410017": {
          "id": 202410017,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "So that's what you call friendly!",
          "next": [
            202410018
          ]
        },
        "202410018": {
          "id": 202410018,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1003,
          "text": "As for pictures, I can't quite remember if I brought any aboard the Express, but I can take a look",
          "next": [
            202410029
          ]
        },
        "202410019": {
          "id": 202410019,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Do you have any hairstyle recommendations, Himeko? I kinda want to change up this mop on my head",
          "next": [
            202410020
          ]
        },
        "202410020": {
          "id": 202410020,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Wait, protection money???",
          "next": [
            202410021
          ]
        },
        "202410021": {
          "id": 202410021,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1003,
          "text": "Hmm? Oh, just a... friendly souvenir I received during my student days",
          "next": [
            202410022
          ]
        },
        "202410022": {
          "id": 202410022,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "So that's what you call friendly!",
          "next": [
            202410023
          ]
        },
        "202410023": {
          "id": 202410023,
          "type": "Sticker",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1003,
          "next": [
            202410029
          ]
        },
        "202410024": {
