          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1003,
          "text": "Oh, just a... friendly souvenir I received during my student days",
          "next": [
            202410027
          ]
        },
        "202410027": {
          "id": 202410027,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "So that's what you call friendly!",
          "next": [
            202410028
          ]
        },
        "202410028": {
          "id": 202410028,
          "type": "Sticker",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1003,
          "next": [
            202410029
          ]
        },
        "202410029": {
          "id": 202410029,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1003,
          "text": "I actually still have a dozen or so wigs stashed away... Back in college, whenever Motoko and I got tired from drafting and repairing, we'd make and trim all sorts of wigs for each other to try on",
          "next": [
            202410030
          ]
        },
        "202410030": {
          "id": 202410030,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "You're changing the subject!",
          "next": [
            202410031
          ]
        },
        "202410031": {
          "id": 202410031,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1003,
          "text": "Now I finally have an excuse to take them out and share them with you all~ I'd love to see what hairstyles and colors each of you like",
          "next": [
            202410032
          ]
        },
        "202410032": {
          "id": 202410032,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1003,
          "text": "Even if they aren't a perfect fit, I should still have my styling touch. I can make adjustments on the spot",
          "next": [
            202410033
          ]
        },
        "202410033": {
          "id": 202410033,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1003,
          "text": "Once everyone is back on the Express, I'll take the lead on this",
          "next": [
            202410034
          ]
        },
